    "child_wall_seconds": "whole child process after imports, set-up to result file",
    "estimated_sgd_seconds_without_diagnostics": "measured_sgd_phase_seconds - estimated overhead",
    "estimated_step_diagnostic_overhead_seconds": "global optimiser steps are numbered from 0 and never reset; diagnostics run at steps s with s % every_n_steps == 0 (before optimizer.step: gradients, parameter snapshot; after it: update stats and the steps.jsonl write, which fall in step s+1's interval). Estimate = sum over those s and s+1 of (step interval - median of the other intervals); biased slightly upward. The first step of each epoch has no interval of its own, so the pre-step diagnostics of step 0 are not separated",
